"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"The value of the `quarkus-dev-service-keycloak` label attached to the "
"started container. This property is used when `shared` is set to `true`. In "
"this case, before starting a container, Dev Services for Keycloak looks for "
"a container with the `quarkus-dev-service-keycloak` label set to the "
"configured value. If found, it will use this container instead of starting a "
"new one. Otherwise, it starts a new container with the `quarkus-dev-service-"
"keycloak` label set to the specified value.\n"
"Container sharing is only used in dev mode.\n"
