"[[quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.-tenant-.token.lifespan-grace]]`link:#quarkus-"
"oidc_quarkus.oidc.-tenant-.token.lifespan-grace[quarkus.oidc.\"tenant\"."
"token.lifespan-grace]`\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Life span grace period in seconds. When checking token expiry, current time "
"is allowed to be later than token expiration time by at most the configured "
"number of seconds. When checking token issuance, current time is allowed to "
"be sooner than token issue time by at most the configured number of seconds.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:"
"+++QUARKUS_OIDC__TENANT__TOKEN_LIFESPAN_GRACE+++[]\n"
"--"
