"+++QUARKUS_OIDC__TENANT__AUTHENTICATION_REDIRECT_PATH+++[]"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"[[quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.-tenant-.authentication.restore-path-after-"
"redirect]]`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.-tenant-.authentication.restore-"
"path-after-redirect[quarkus.oidc.\"tenant\".authentication.restore-path-"
"after-redirect]`\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"If this property is set to 'true' then the original request URI which was "
"used before the authentication will be restored after the user has been "
"redirected back to the application. Note if `redirectPath` property is not "
"set, the original request URI will be restored even if this property is "
"disabled.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:"
"+++QUARKUS_OIDC__TENANT__AUTHENTICATION_RESTORE_PATH_AFTER_REDIRECT+++[]\n"
"--"
